{"data":{"status":true,"competition":{"id":1765493,"visibility":"public","theme_colour":"blue_un","paid":0,"title":"AlgoSSTrike","festival_id":520986,"organization_id":825345,"web_url":null,"start_date":"2026-10-03T00:00:00+05:30","end_date":"2026-11-28T15:00:00+05:30","location":null,"type":"hackathons","public_url":"hackathons\/algosstrike-scaler-school-of-technology-bengaluru-karnataka-1765493","region":"hybrid","details":"<h1><strong>AlgoSSTrike&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h1>\n<p class=\"p1\">\"THINK FAST . CODE FASTER.\"<\/p>\n<p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Enter the ultimate coding showdown where logic meets speed. Solve challenges, outsmart competitors and put your programming skills to the ultimate test.<br \/><br \/><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Team-based competitive programming contest testing algorithmic skills, coding speed, and teamwork .Compete against top coders, solve challenging problems, and aim to win prizes.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Contest Format:<\/strong><strong><br \/><br \/><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong>Online Qualifier:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Type: Team contest (3 participants per team)<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Duration: 3 hours<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Details: Solve a series of algorithmic and data structure problems under a strict time limit; top performers qualify for Offline Finals<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Offline Finals:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Type: Team contest (3 participants per team) ICPC style Contest<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Duration: 4 hours<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Details: Top teams compete offline in a high-pressure environment, showcasing problem-solving ability, speed, and collaboration<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Team Composition:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Each team consists of 3 participants<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Languages Allowed: C, C++, Java, Python<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Internet Access: Limited to contest platform only; no external assistance allowed<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Disqualification: Plagiarism, code-sharing, or use of external solutions; multiple registrations prohibited<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Late Logins: Not permitted<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Independent Coding: Teams must code independently without external discussions or assistance<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Offline Finals : OBS recording setup is mandatory , recording should be done throughout the contest<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p class=\"amber-dark_un-border-before hdng mock-title\">&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><strong>Location:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Online Qualifier: Accessible anywhere with an internet connection<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Offline Finals: Conducted at Scaler School of Technology<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/><br \/><\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Disqualification Criteria:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Plagiarism &amp; Code Theft:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Unauthorized solution sharing, duplicating logic from other teams, or utilizing external code snippets.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>External Support:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Use of Generative AI (ChatGPT, Copilot, etc.), communication platforms (Discord, Telegram), or any form of outside mentorship.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Identity Integrity:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Registering via multiple accounts, cross-team participation, or utilizing several handles for a single individual.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><strong>Procedural Violations:<\/strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Disregarding proctor directives, tampering with networking\/hardware, or breaching venue conduct standards.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Teams that fail to produce a valid OBS recording or show evidence of external assistance are disqualified immediately.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>","overall_prizes":"Exciting cash prizes, exclusive goodies, and certificates await the winners!","regn_open":1,"regn_type":1,"regn_url":null,"regn_email":"","registration_clicks":0,"user_id":28043294,"moderation_status":1,"overall_leaderboard":0,"reject_reason":null,"display_date":null,"created_at":"2026-10-04T00:01:28+05:30","updated_at":"2026-10-05T04:26:42+05:30","communication_sent":null,"certificate_at":null,"remarks":null,"branding":0,"disable_auto_rounds":null,"certificate_config":null,"subtype":"online_coding_challenge","combined_leaderboard":null,"source":nul